        <activityName xml:lang="en">2-butanol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 2-butanol, at plant
The multioutput-process "butene hydration" delivers the co-products 2-butanol and butanes from butenes. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 226492ee-15a8-3e7a-93ba-87928e6801f9
Hydration of butene including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydration of butene
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_226492ee-15a8-3e7a-93ba-87928e6801f9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
